      },
      "targets": [],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "| Layer | Coverage | Signals |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Public edge | **Measured** | HTTPS availability, HTTP status, DNS, TLS, and response phases. |\n| Application/API | **Measured** | Public Frappe ping endpoint. |\n| Containers | **Measured** | Eight ERPNext and Redis containers, running and Docker health state. |\n| Data dependencies | **Measured** | Authenticated Redis PING checks for ERPNext cache, queue, and socketio roles. |\n| Host resources | **Measured** | Shared host CPU, memory, disk, and network; these are not container-specific. |"
      }
